      text: (I) => `Rule ${I.rule}: a cell's next state is bit (4·left + 2·self + right) of ${I.rule} = ${I.rule.toString(2).padStart(8, "0")}₂ (cells beyond the ends are 0). The top row is the start. In the row below, select the cells that are on after ${I.k} step${I.k > 1 ? "s" : ""}.`,
